  "item": [
    {
      "name": "HU-06 Carga de foto",
      "description": "HU-06: el usuario sube la foto de su comida (POST /api/v1/meals/photos, multipart con el campo \"photo\"). Solo JPEG y PNG, detectados por contenido, y máximo 5 MiB (TEC-13).\n\nLos archivos de prueba están en backend/postman/meals/files/ y se referencian relativos a backend/: en Postman, Settings → General → Working directory debe ser la carpeta backend/ del repositorio (newman se ejecuta desde backend/). Ejecutar en orden.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "00 - Preparación: registrar al usuario",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "{",
                  "    const email = \"meals.user.\" + Date.now() + \".\" + Math.floor(Math.random() * 1e6) + \"@macrofit.test\";",
                  "    pm.variables.set(\"email\", email);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"meals_user_email\", email);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "{",
                  "    pm.test(\"Status 201 Created\", function () {",
                  "        pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "    });",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.test(\"Rol user\", function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(data.role).to.eql(\"user\");",
                  "    });",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"meals_user_id\", data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Crea al usuario (rol user). Guarda su id en {{meals_user_id}}.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Usuario Fotos\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{test_password}}\",\n  \"role\": \"user\",\n  \"privacy_accepted\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
